{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20527","headline":"送杨少尹赴凤翔 · 张籍","name":"送杨少尹赴凤翔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗名往日动长安，首首人家卷里看。\n西学已行秦博士，南宫新拜汉郎官。\n得钱祗了还书铺，借宅常时事药栏。\n今去岐州生计薄，移居偏近陇头寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}